WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:05.919
Speaker 1: All right, we're going to start
today with what many of you e-mailed me about

00:00:05.919 --> 00:00:13.750
with very different opinions, this is the
news that YouTube has now officially banned

00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:22.340
all anti vaccine content and even some sort
of perennial anti vaccine content creators.

00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:27.630
And some of you emailing me saying this is
absolutely horrifying, even though I'm pro

00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:28.630
vaccine.

00:00:28.630 --> 00:00:33.680
Many of you said allowing YouTube to be the
arbiter, arbiter of what counts as an anti

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:36.350
vaccine or not is very problematic.

00:00:36.350 --> 00:00:41.920
Others wrote to me and said, David, is is
this really a big deal or not?

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:45.500
And the answer is that this is a major content
decision.

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:49.850
But what's being missed by many of the articles
and many of the people e-mailing me is that

00:00:49.850 --> 00:00:54.620
it's not much of a change to YouTube's content
policy around anti vaccine content.

00:00:54.620 --> 00:01:00.660
This this has been 90 percent of the policy
for the last many, many months anyway.

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:02.530
And this actually represents a pretty minor
change.

00:01:02.530 --> 00:01:05.160
So let's look at some of the reporting on
this.

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:10.030
Reuters writing YouTube blocks all anti vaccine
content.

00:01:10.030 --> 00:01:15.430
YouTube will block all anti vaccine content
moving beyond its ban on false information

00:01:15.430 --> 00:01:21.120
about the covid vaccines to include content
that contains misinformation about other approved

00:01:21.120 --> 00:01:24.110
vaccines, it said in a blog post on Wednesday.

00:01:24.110 --> 00:01:28.780
Examples of content that won't be allowed
on YouTube include claims that the flu vaccine

00:01:28.780 --> 00:01:35.440
causes infertility and that the MMR shot the
measles, mumps, rubella shot can cause autism.

00:01:35.440 --> 00:01:41.570
The online video company owned by Alphabet
Google is also banning channels associated

00:01:41.570 --> 00:01:48.810
with several prominent anti vaccine activists,
including Robert F. Kennedy Jr. and Joseph

00:01:48.810 --> 00:01:53.840
Mercola, a YouTube spokesperson said.

00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:57.550
The move comes as YouTube and tech giants
like Facebook and Twitter have been criticized

00:01:57.550 --> 00:02:01.550
for not doing enough to stop the spread of
false information.

00:02:01.550 --> 00:02:05.479
But even as YouTube takes a tougher stance,
it faces backlash around the world.

00:02:05.479 --> 00:02:12.890
Russian state backed broadcaster Arties German
language channels were deleted from YouTube

00:02:12.890 --> 00:02:16.880
as the company said the channels breached
its covert misinformation policy.

00:02:16.880 --> 00:02:24.680
Russia called the move unprecedented information
aggression and threatened to block YouTube.

00:02:24.680 --> 00:02:30.310
Now I have to tell you guys, this is barely
a change in policy from what's been the case

00:02:30.310 --> 00:02:31.610
for a long time.

00:02:31.610 --> 00:02:38.020
And there's also some confusion about banning
content versus monetizing content.

00:02:38.020 --> 00:02:42.060
Let's look at one more article and then we're
going to get into those details.

00:02:42.060 --> 00:02:50.069
NBC article says YouTube cracks down on anti
vaccine videos, bans major accounts.

00:02:50.069 --> 00:02:54.040
YouTube announced a total ban Wednesday on
vaccine misinformation and the termination

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:56.880
of accounts of several prominent anti vaccine
influencers.

00:02:56.880 --> 00:02:58.470
I already named them Joseph Mercola.

00:02:58.470 --> 00:02:59.650
Robert F. Kennedy Jr..

00:02:59.650 --> 00:03:05.470
The new policy was crafted as the company
began to see false claims about covid-19 vaccines

00:03:05.470 --> 00:03:08.819
spill over into misinformation about vaccines.

00:03:08.819 --> 00:03:14.760
In general, YouTube already had a policy against
covid vaccine misinformation.

00:03:14.760 --> 00:03:20.280
But the new ban against broader vaccine misinformation
includes content that falsely claims approved

00:03:20.280 --> 00:03:25.530
vaccines are dangerous or ineffective, including
the false belief that vaccines cause autism

00:03:25.530 --> 00:03:26.590
or cancer.

00:03:26.590 --> 00:03:32.780
So the most important line in all of these
articles is that this policy already existed

00:03:32.780 --> 00:03:35.890
with relation to covid vaccines.

00:03:35.890 --> 00:03:38.849
This is only a tweak in that.

00:03:38.849 --> 00:03:46.220
Now, more general anti vaccine stuff will
also be banned, 99 percent of the, quote,

00:03:46.220 --> 00:03:47.520
problematic content.

00:03:47.520 --> 00:03:52.370
Over the last eight, nine months since the
covid vaccines have been out has been related

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:54.630
specifically to covid vaccines.

00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:56.769
And that has already been banned.

00:03:56.769 --> 00:04:01.500
Whether it's enforced and policed in every
case on such a large platform is a different

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:02.500
question.

00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:11.959
But what most people are reacting to is reacting
as if this is about covid vaccine stuff, specifically

00:04:11.959 --> 00:04:13.010
the covid vaccine.

00:04:13.010 --> 00:04:15.280
Disinformation has already been banned.

00:04:15.280 --> 00:04:22.430
This is now expanding it like two percent
to say in general, covid vaccine misinformation

00:04:22.430 --> 00:04:27.409
not covered by vaccine misinformation is now
going to be banned as well.

00:04:27.409 --> 00:04:35.110
Also, the vast majority of YouTube content
is allowed, but some of it is not monetized.

00:04:35.110 --> 00:04:38.659
And that's another aspect of this that many
people are being confused by.

00:04:38.659 --> 00:04:40.800
There's a whole bunch of stuff.

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:47.590
That is what we would call edgy for for lack
of a better term, which is allowed on YouTube.

00:04:47.590 --> 00:04:51.800
The vast majority of content is allowed on
YouTube, but you can't monetize all of it.

00:04:51.800 --> 00:04:53.029
And that applies to me as well.

00:04:53.029 --> 00:04:58.849
There's stuff that's too edgy that I cover
related to war or conflicts, terrorism.

00:04:58.849 --> 00:04:59.849
That's not monitor.

00:04:59.849 --> 00:05:06.389
Sizable, but it's allowed and the vast majority
of even kind of like edgy content is allowed,

00:05:06.389 --> 00:05:07.970
but not necessarily monetize.

00:05:07.970 --> 00:05:13.090
So I have to tell you, I think this is mostly
much ado about nothing.

00:05:13.090 --> 00:05:18.120
I think Facebook is a lot more to blame for
this stuff than YouTube.

00:05:18.120 --> 00:05:24.080
But YouTube actually has been cracking down
on conspiracy misinformation for a while now,

00:05:24.080 --> 00:05:25.419
maybe not as much as they should have been.

00:05:25.419 --> 00:05:28.800
If there's a criticism, it's they haven't
done enough.

00:05:28.800 --> 00:05:34.270
They've gone out of their way to provide official
information about coronavirus vaccines, et

00:05:34.270 --> 00:05:35.270
cetera.

00:05:35.270 --> 00:05:37.960
When the algorithm detects that, that's the
subject matter.

00:05:37.960 --> 00:05:38.990
Was it enough?

00:05:38.990 --> 00:05:46.460
No, but I'm seeing way more problematic stuff
spread and be signal boosted on Facebook,

00:05:46.460 --> 00:05:53.580
where it's really generating even more denialism
and perpetuating disinformation.

00:05:53.580 --> 00:06:00.110
And one of the things I've been thinking about
a lot lately, and I know this is a big statement

00:06:00.110 --> 00:06:06.400
at this point, I think Facebook is is probably
a net negative, probably a net negative.

00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:10.979
I think YouTube is still a net positive.

00:06:10.979 --> 00:06:15.960
OK, there's so much amazing instructional
and documentary content, cooking, gardening,

00:06:15.960 --> 00:06:20.189
so, so many things on on YouTube that are
just fantastic.

00:06:20.189 --> 00:06:24.099
And there are problems with misinformation
spreading on YouTube as well.

00:06:24.099 --> 00:06:27.949
I'm just not sure that Facebook is at all
a net positive.

00:06:27.949 --> 00:06:33.899
We still publish to Facebook because I think
Facebook exists and I'd rather Facebook have

00:06:33.899 --> 00:06:35.999
our content than not have it.

00:06:35.999 --> 00:06:38.610
But that's a real question for me at this
point in time.

00:06:38.610 --> 00:06:43.389
If that topic is interesting, by the way,
I highly recommend the book Tech Nappily by

00:06:43.389 --> 00:06:44.889
the Critic Neil Postman.

00:06:44.889 --> 00:06:46.589
I'm almost done reading it.

00:06:46.589 --> 00:06:51.090
He's way more straight up like anti technology
than I am.

00:06:51.090 --> 00:06:56.229
But the book, which is actually from the 90s,
perfectly predicts the conundrum we're in

00:06:56.229 --> 00:06:59.569
with social media platforms right now and
the downsides of tech.

00:06:59.569 --> 00:07:03.169
And it's very much a worthwhile read now as
far as the decision by YouTube.

00:07:03.169 --> 00:07:06.849
Either way, the conspiracy theorists, we're
going to say YouTube is against them.

00:07:06.849 --> 00:07:07.919
They banned the content.

00:07:07.919 --> 00:07:12.729
The anti Voxer say YouTube is participating
in the suppression, but they'd say it either

00:07:12.729 --> 00:07:13.729
way.

00:07:13.729 --> 00:07:16.690
And so I think that this is definitely the
right decision.

00:07:16.690 --> 00:07:20.960
Is there some concern about who gets to decide
what counts as an tiebacks?

00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:21.960
Sure.

00:07:21.960 --> 00:07:28.610
Yeah, any time, you know, being the gatekeeper
brings with it its own set of questions and

00:07:28.610 --> 00:07:30.139
problems, that's always a problem.

00:07:30.139 --> 00:07:31.589
It's not new here.

00:07:31.589 --> 00:07:36.150
And you don't say that these companies can't
enforce terms of service and terms and conditions

00:07:36.150 --> 00:07:37.689
as a result.

00:07:37.689 --> 00:08:59.490
And unfortunately, that's that's the claim
that many 

00:08:59.490 --> 00:09:12.230
are making.

